    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 1.0]",
    "content" : "It is conjectured in [Mor93] and [Kaw97] that the movable eﬀective cone of a Calabi-Yau manifold has a rational fundamental domain under the action of the birational automorphism group."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
