    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 1.0]",
    "content" : "Conjecture 1.0.1 (Kawamata-Morrison cone conjecture) Let X be a Calabi-Yau manifold. Then there exists a rational polyhedral fundamental domain Π for the action of the birational automorphism group Bir(X) on the movable eﬀective cone Move(X) in the sense that"
