    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 1.0]",
    "content" : "The fact that the birational automorphism group of a general Wehler N-fold is Lorentzian provides a hyperbolic subspace in PN1(X), and plays an important role when investigating the stucture of ∂Eﬀ(X) (see [FLT23, §2.3]). Let n = (n1,··· ,nl) ∈ N such that |n| ≥ 4 and n = (2,2). In [Ya´22], the author generalized the results in [CO15], and proved the Kawamata-Morrison cone conjecture when X is a general Calabi-Yau complete intersection in Pn := Pn1"
  }, {
